NPCs: {
	Recorder: {
		DisplayName: Recorder
		Name: Nina
		Copy: Copy
		Collect: Unlock
		Reward: Reward
		GiveLifeCrystal: Give the Life Crystal
		LifeCrystalHealed: You seem a bit healthier... do you eat these often?
		Spawn: Spawning Recorder
		Progress: Collecting Progress{0}
		FindSlime: Missing pet?
		FindSlimeDialogue:
			'''
			Well, I had a pet slime, but it seems that I can't find it recently 
			... would you help me to find it?
			'''
		HowManyRequiredForReward: Collect {0} more records, and you can get a new item from me, Keep it up
		HowManyRequiredToFullClear: There's only {0} records left, you are almost done it!
		AllRecordUnlocked: All the records known has been collected yet, thanks for your effort! Have fun

		TownNPCMood: {
			Content: This place is decent... if you ignore those little annoyances
			NoHome: A chair and a workbench are enough; a jail cell is fine too. I just want somewhere to rest
			FarFromHome: I've walked too far... I can't find my way back at all
			LoveSpace: It's a little too quiet here for comfort. Maybe I should suggest moving a few neighbors in
			DislikeCrowded: Sound has nowhere to go here—it always finds its way into my ears. Maybe it's too crowded
			HateCrowded: Sound has nowhere to go here—it always finds its way into my ears. Maybe it's too crowded
			LikeBiome: "{BiomeName}—sand, sunshine, and gentle sea breeze. Everything is perfect beyond words"
			DislikeBiome: It's so hot here my head spins; the dreadful imagery {BiomeName} brings pales in comparison
			LoveNPC: I like {NPCName}. She's the only one I know who can wrap a bandage faster than she talks nonsense
			LikeNPC: "{NPCName} always invites me to her parties"
			HateNPC: Whenever {NPCName} is around, my pistol keeps going off. Should I fire a round at him?
			LikeNPC_Princess: I like {NPCName}.
			Princess_LovesNPC: I love being around {NPCName}—the sparkling stories she collects are as delightful as stars!
		}
	}

	DreamSlime: {
		DisplayName: Dream Slime
		Name: TuanZi
		TownNPCMood.NoHome: *Hrumble grumble* ?
	}
}

Bestiary: {
	Recorder: {
		Common: She seems indifferent to everything, even her own work... (the rest of the writing has been smudged out)
		Request: "{0}? I have something to tell you. Click this line with your mouse"
		Warn: Peeking at someone's personal information isn't very polite
